        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "NEW TO THE MARKET\r\n\r\nKNOCK, CO. MAYO\r\n\r\nPRIME DEVELOPMENT SITE\r\n\r\nAVAILABLE IN ONE LOT OR INDIVIDUAL SITES\r\n\r\nNigel Dineen & Martin Finn Auctioneers are delighted to present this prime development opportunity situated on the outskirts of Knock Village, Co. Mayo.\r\n\r\nThe lands have been fully developed and levelled into high-quality building ground and are being offered for sale subject to the proposed purchasers obtaining planning permission.\r\n\r\nThe property comprises c.2.01 acres in total with extensive frontage onto the main road together with additional frontage onto a side road, offering excellent accessibility and future development potential.\r\n\r\nServices including public water, public sewerage and electricity are all available adjacent to the property.\r\n\r\nFolio Numbers:\r\n\r\n• MY6145F – c.1.25 acres\r\n• MY55205F – c.0.76 acres\r\n\r\nTotal Area: c.2.01 Acres"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Prime development opportunity\r\n• Available in one lot or individual sites\r\n• c.2.01 acres in total\r\n• Extensive road frontage\r\n• Frontage onto two roads\r\n• Levelled and prepared building ground\r\n• Public water available\r\n• Public sewerage available\r\n• Electricity passing the property\r\n• Excellent future potential subject to planning"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Local Highlights",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "• Situated on the outskirts of Knock Village\r\n• Walking distance to village amenities\r\n• Close to Knock Shrine\r\n• Approx. 10 minutes to Ireland West Airport Knock\r\n• Easy access to Ballyhaunis, Claremorris and Kiltimagh\r\n• Excellent connectivity to the N17 Galway–Sligo route"
      },
